# Doppelgang ({X}{X}{X}{G}{U}): "For each of X target permanents, create X tokens that are copies of that permanent." (CR 107.3, 608.2b, 707.2, 111.1). Bot1 pays for X = 2 with eight mana
# (three {X} = 6, {G}, {U}): Black Lotus (3) and five Moxen. The two targets are an opponent's Ornithopter and Bot1's own Mox Pearl, which is tapped for mana already: its copies are tokens that are
# copies, untapped. Each target gets exactly X = 2 tokens: two Ornithopters (for Bot1, who controls the tokens) and two Mox Pearls, so three Pearls in all. The opponent's Ornithopter stays where it was.

